# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRIVACY-CRITICAL
#
# This project reads AI agent transcripts, which contain prompts, responses,
# source code and absolute paths. Nothing derived from real transcripts may be
# committed unless it has been through `cargo xtask redact` first.
#
# `tests/fixtures/**` is re-included below and is the ONLY place JSONL may live.
# `cargo test fixtures_are_redacted` enforces that what lands there is scrubbed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.jsonl
!tests/fixtures/**/*.jsonl

# Local capture database and its WAL/SHM siblings
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db
*.db-*

# Scratch space for local experiments — never committed
scratch/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Rust ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# ── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ── Editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.env.local
